licence and the WordNet licence, with public-domain parts; every notice is in
assets/dictionaries/README_en_US.txt and in the editor's About.

Spelling checker: spellbook (https://github.com/helix-editor/spellbook), under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0; its source is at that address and on crates.io, unmodified.
